Insex is def. an outstanding legend in the cyber world. A true revolution. An S&M icon so high, that can never be reached, even in an era when everything is free & loading for a second through the well known you…somethingelse.com websites. Cause where is the quality and the following of the product… and tell me, where, where is the pain?

The art, I mean.

However, **Graphic Sexual Terror** is a great documentary telling the story behind the website. Deep, well edited, yet looking spontaneous enough. Good development of the characters too. Definitely can’t be boring.

Extreme. Yes.

Exciting. You’re gonna tell me…

